Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,======================================== TEXT ========================================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,往这边传
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.27,0:00:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,后面后面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 传球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了 月菜酱好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,冷艳美人融合在一起了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,之后在大庭广众下摔倒了 好丢人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不擅长运动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要记下石川同学的动作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,下场比赛没准能用上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.32,0:01:26.40,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,加油 加油…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,帅呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.65,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,能看到石川同学的英姿 是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.06,0:01:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学果然是个帅气的吸血鬼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学！
Comment: 0,0:01:59.02,0:01:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天使
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,出口请保持安静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是 为什么变这么小了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,难道是 肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,饭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.07,0:04:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.17,0:04:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,早就料到会有这种事了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢 感觉这是危险的饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只要吃了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,曲奇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,敲一下的话不是会变成两个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 也不是每次都能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,下半场开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,上吧 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.01,0:04:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们先想办法顶住
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你让月菜酱吸个血吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.21,0:05:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,吸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,婴儿爬了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,用不上力 没办法好好地咬呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,被人得分了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办 我能做些什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这里血还没止住
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话肯定比平时好吸血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想再看一次 石川同学帅气的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,B班 干的好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.83,0:06:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不会让你们得逞的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.04,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,舔…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有点苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.30,0:07:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为刚才消毒过了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她说好苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间 传球
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,果然石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.75,0:07:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,成功
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,MVP就是你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 大鸟 太帅了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,非常厉害哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,女神现世啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,人家是吸血鬼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.31,0:08:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,都是靠着大家的帮忙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.57,0:08:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你真行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.16,0:08:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,手还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 没什么大碍
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学的灌篮 真的好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.52,0:08:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,会努力学会怎么吸血
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,成为更帅的吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我练习一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子饿了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那个酷酷的石川同学竟然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是哪个石川同学都好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.75,0:09:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我咬下去的话 你又会疼了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不用在意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,痛痛的 飞走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好 没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,吸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要变成妈妈了…
Comment: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-------------
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要在足球部享受青春啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是轻音部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是超自然研究部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要一起画漫画啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 我们是网球部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,请看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.98,0:10:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那个什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好像最近社团在招一年级新生参观
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.67,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学想加入什么社团吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说 至今都没那个闲心去想这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好饿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 现在应该能加个社团试试了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想加入能吸血的社团
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.56,0:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就能在放学后练习了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我又不是新生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,可以去参观社团吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗  那我试着去参观看看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟也会去的吧  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看见演剧部了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,要进去看看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.57,0:11:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这是在某栋高级的宅邸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.76,0:11:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是石川同学和大鸟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来参观啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学为什么在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这来得也太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么为什么为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,人家都说是来参观的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,座长 那可是石川同学耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在念台词
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学要不要也来试试？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.39,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是发生在某栋高级的宅邸的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,仅有一夜的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.16,0:11:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,森林深处 强风席卷的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,生存还是死亡 这是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,帅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 既是我的侄子 亦是我的儿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 我们去灭鬼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我念错了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,诶  没念错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟的树演得也很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么突然有股寒意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,从那里传来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:12:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那时的吸血鬼同学
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.16,0:13:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那时？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是为了被我们研究而来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请务必来参观我们社团
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟 再跑快点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们好像召唤了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以要被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要继续参观吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,还是休息一会？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 我还想看看其他社团
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:13:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得很好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,边见同学？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.22,0:14:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也有你？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我身兼多社哟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,死语？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now来了Young的新生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会进来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,砰地准备好就没问题啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.38,0:14:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天已经被订走了先撤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.47,0:14:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她们在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们学校 有趣的社团也太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,排球部好像在体育馆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,接球100个 开始咯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,难度好高
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间同学好有干劲哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下一球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,遭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再打破的话 要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,本校的排球部连战连败
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,下次的地区大赛我们真的很想赢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都很努力练习
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,但因为努力过头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,弄坏了很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再这样下去我们会被废部的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,事不过三哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是很危急了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.12,0:15:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,三条命制的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想应该不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱运动神经很好 又很可靠
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你能来体验一整天的话会很感激的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,既然你都这么说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,补给站
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.08,0:16:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,作战会议开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,主将有什么想说的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,既然小月菜加入我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 咕噜噜噜 嘣的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啥玩意 你刚说的是战术吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们社团一直这样来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.02,0:16:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,基本没开过什么像样的作战会议
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.79,0:16:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,既然被拜托了那我就上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,赌上我高贵吸血鬼之名
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,咕噜噜噜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.05,0:17:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嘣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了月菜酱我们什么都没打坏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.23,0:17:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,应该是多亏了大家的努力啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小月菜果然很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,头脑好还擅长运动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,作为吸血鬼其实很菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我还是学着去融入大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你好努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 是你太夸张了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,地区大赛我们会靠自己加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,总不能一直依赖你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,作为今天的谢礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,血给你吸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是对努力的月菜一点奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,无论是哪个我都很开心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.08,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但有努力的是你才对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.49,0:18:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间 你去哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为太努力了 所以下次再战哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起啊 明明是我要参观社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,却让你一直陪我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.15,0:19:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟我也没什么机会参观别的社团
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很开心的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你要加入排球部吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不了 虽然玩的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.50,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但佐久间说想靠她们自己的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这些社团和我设想中的不太一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是说不能吸血吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.51,0:19:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是其中之一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 要采光不好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.01,0:19:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,其次是人得少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:19:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,朝北
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,两楼以上有冷暖气的边房
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要住那吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这学校确实社团很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但你这要求的也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,美术部？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,其实是前辈们都毕业了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在社员就我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,部长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你咋不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我要加入
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,采光不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.07,0:20:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,人少
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,朝北
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.85,0:20:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,2楼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有冷暖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,边房
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.39,0:20:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,条件完全符合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.93,0:20:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而且这还有大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可以随便练习
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有人要篡位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会做社团活动啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.53,0:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然也没什么正经的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 没关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.25,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.02,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说这里符合你的条件
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但学校里不也有不少其他社团吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.22,0:21:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,话说到底 这社团就我一人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不会无聊吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就算如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,应该说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样才好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,既然要练习就要喝好喝的血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.84,0:21:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学要是入社的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎你随时来玩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.38,0:21:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也加油努力练习哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉就像是妨碍工作的猫
Comment: 0,0:21:59.97,0:21:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,===========ED=========
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.06,0:23:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,下集
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.02,0:23:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不擅长吸血的吸血鬼酱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼酱与烹饪实习
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,与吸血鬼酱逛街

